{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_title", "source_sha256": "ee452b9a7f379cc73a77cc30ecda399a4f11f9082dc9efe2cd3dcd6d096fa98d", "ja": "瑞希とおでかけ1", "zh": "和瑞希出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5158b5786a7fe835a5dd7087df32f7eabc2a5414bd40b6a9a1e955281554a6bf", "ja": "瑞希とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和瑞希一同外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "997a3335c3182f45e9e332539ccaca9e97f1018de58eb4a88abd1086eedb7fce", "ja": "（今日は瑞希の、秋田グルメの食レポの仕事だ。\n撮影隊が見守る中、瑞希がきりたんぽ鍋をつつく）", "zh": "（今天是瑞希做秋田美食试吃报道的工作。在拍摄团队的注视下，瑞希正用筷子夹着切蒲英火锅里的食材）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "4c81a2671b2acf3b1a61281e3b789424cccbef8043f3456ba8a3b5017e64782e", "ja": "地鶏とキノコの入ったお鍋です。きりたんぽも、\nよく煮えています。……火傷には、ご注意を。", "zh": "这是放了本地鸡和蘑菇的火锅。烤米棒也\n煮得非常透彻。……小心烫伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "fecee9be99a7b7e9856bf853a64b7b94f102f463d53f2250d2efff41b269d201", "ja": "はふはふ、あつい。あついぞ……\nでもとってもおいしい、きりたんぽです。", "zh": "呼——呼——好烫，好烫啊……\n不过，这个烤米棒真的特别好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "3f3a5510a79db8d2f09d0db2b4fed4930631f1543c81273fdd07792b64c46c5d", "ja": "……おいしいです。\n……。", "zh": "……很好吃。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1b2112526d03dd26d5726357daace9eb0fe4fa8feddfa6083badd9f2166d35f8", "ja": "（まずい、黙ってしまった……！　いや、\nあの間はもしかして、意図的なものか……？）", "zh": "（糟糕，不小心沉默了……不对，刚才那段停顿，说不定是故意的……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "92c9bf90aea5e3301e0eef09d6a0a1aa6b913516142605865f64f3c129b09dc2", "ja": "…………。おいしくて、言葉になりません。\n……感動、だぞ。", "zh": "……太好吃了，已经无法用语言表达。\n……这就是感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "379d508f77388b24aaa0b6d88ecf0936495700e3ef1c5f4a6dfaebd536f9622e", "ja": "（なるほど、無口なのを逆手に取り、説得力を\n増させるという手法か。やるな、瑞希！）", "zh": "（原来如此，是反过来利用自己的沉默寡言，来增加说服力的方法吗。干得漂亮，瑞希！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "2f8e09bb6362b9decd9e555602ce207cec9019808647211f77b3f1e03ebdd230", "ja": "おいしくて、おいしくて、言葉にならない。\nみなさんも来よう、秋田。……ぐっ。", "zh": "好吃，好吃到无法用语言形容。\n大家也来秋田吧。……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1008_staff", "source_sha256": "9e4a2aa700240e24e6154a2cd850899d1a22790a72990d796de87f0670a2cbe3", "ja": "……はい、オッケーです！　真壁さん、今の\nすごく良かったです！　ありがとうございました！", "zh": "……好，OK！真壁小姐，刚才的\n表现非常棒！非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "086e36150aca91ad11704d9d5eed091cd9449ee959f11844db8c3a68b80e17f4", "ja": "（瑞希の食レポは、大好評だった！\nツアー先で、いい成果を残す事ができたな……！）", "zh": "（瑞希的美食测评大受好评！在巡演地取得了不错的成果啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
